# =========================================================
# ROADMAP: INQUIRY TO QUOTATION WORKFLOW
# Sakop: client inquiry, admin lead filtering, engineer inspection/costing,
# automatic quotation computation, admin approval, and client sending.
# =========================================================

# 1. NEXT TASK: Site Inspection Scheduling
# - Add DB table: site_inspections
# - Link each schedule to service_inquiries.id
# - Admin chooses engineer, inspection date/time, site notes, and status
# - Status flow: For Inspection -> Scheduled -> Inspected -> Ready for Costing
# - Engineer sees only assigned inspection schedules

# 2. Engineer Inspection & Costing Workspace
# - Engineer opens assigned inspection
# - Engineer adds materials from Inventory
# - Engineer adds labor cost, equipment/asset needs, remarks, and duration
# - System saves costing draft linked to inquiry/project

# 3. Quotation Auto-Generation
# - System computes material total, labor total, other cost, markup, VAT if needed
# - Generate quotation record and PDF
# - Keep quotation status: Draft -> For Admin Approval -> Approved -> Sent to Client

# 4. Admin Quotation Approval
# - Admin reviews generated quotation
# - Admin approves, rejects, or sends back to Engineer for revision
# - Log all actions in audit logs

# 5. Client Sending & Tracking
# - Admin marks quotation as sent to client
# - Track client response: Pending, Accepted, Rejected, Revision Requested
# - If accepted, convert inquiry/quotation into project record
